<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-6029] zeppelin-0.11.1-bin-all.tgz contains obsolete hidden files</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-6029</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The official binary Download from zeppelin.apache.org - &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.cgi/zeppelin/zeppelin-0.11.1/zeppelin-0.11.1-bin-all.tgz&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.cgi/zeppelin/zeppelin-0.11.1/zeppelin-0.11.1-bin-all.tgz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;contains defective hidden Files.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For every $FILE inside the Archive there is a second file called &quot;._FILE&quot;, e.g.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;./lib/libthrift-0.13.0.jar&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;./lib/._libthrift-0.13.0.jar&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This breaks the start of Spark Interpreters on YARN, as the defective Files get transferred to the Hadoop Cluster and then cause extraction Errors.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Fix is quite easy: remove all files with leading &quot;._&quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please fix the release Process for Zeppelin to only contain the required Files.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
